    {
      "text": "二十多名Shard横跨火、电、水、自然与水晶五种元素，可自由混编理想阵容",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Over 20 Shards can join your squad! Experiment and discover which ones will become your favorites! FORM AN ELEMENTAL SQUAD Choose Shards of Fire, Electric, Water, Nature, and Crystal!",
